{{Term/Store|Fashion Passion||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Armor Shop]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|Fashion Passion|Sign|BotW}}</ref><ref name="Sign">{{Cite|Fashion Passion<br/>Open at Kara Kara Bazaar|Sign|TotK}}</ref>

==Features and Overview==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Fashion Passion is the local [[Armor Shop]] of [[Gerudo Town]]. The Shop sells the complete, [[Gerudo Outfit]] is sold here at a total of 540 [[Rupee]]s, which is 60 Rupees cheaper than what [[Vilia]] sells them for.<ref>{{Cite|What do you think? Do you want to buy them for...{{Color BotW|Red|600 rupees}}?|Vilia|BotW}}</ref> The Gerudo Outfit here has also been [[Hateno Dye|Dyed]] white, as opposed to the regular coloring that Vilia sells. According to Saula, this is because it is currently trendy for [[Gerudo]] women to dye their clothes.<ref>{{Cite|Changing the color of your clothes is a really trendy thing to do right now for young vai traveling beyond town!|Saula|BotW}}</ref> She explains that one can do so at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] in [[Hateno Village]].<ref>{{Cite|There's a store in Hateno Village—the {{Color BotW|Blue|Kochi Dye Shop}}—where you can dye your clothes!|Saula|BotW}}</ref> Though [[Link]] already has a Gerudo Outfit, Saula suggests that he buy more sets in order to have different colors.<ref>{{Cite|Geez, it looks really good on you! How about one more to try in a {{Color BotW|Blue|different color}}! You've got to buy it!|Saula|BotW}}</ref>

Through the doorway behind Fashion Passion is a curtain, which conceals an entrance to the [[Gerudo Secret Club]]. If Link attempts to enter, Saula stops him, telling him that the doorway is not for customers.<ref>{{Cite|Ah, um, that doorway isn't for customers, actually...|Saula|BotW}}</ref> She then whispers that he should use the door on the side of the building if he is a member of the Club.<ref>{{Cite|{{Small|If you're a member, please head around to the door on the side.}}|Saula|BotW}}</ref>

As Link passes by Fashion Passion, Saula will beckon him over.<ref>{{Cite|Over here!|Saula|BotW}}</ref> When Link makes a purchase from the Armor Shop, Saula will thank him.<ref>{{Cite|Sarqso.|Saula|BotW}}</ref> She will also give Link fashion advice, which includes wearing all pieces of an [[Armor Set]] together and Dyeing clothes.<ref>{{Cite|I recommend wearing all the items from a particular series as a set!|Saula|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|It's also a fashionable thing among vai lately to wear different colors of clothes that are from the same set.|Saula|BotW}}</ref> If Link buys the entire Gerudo Outfit that Saula is selling, she will once again suggest Dyeing.<ref>{{Cite|All our Gerudo clothing is sold out now. If you already have a lot of clothes, you should think about filling out your wardrobe with different colors instead.|Saula|BotW}}</ref>

